# Go
*.test
*.out

# Never commit anything resembling real session data or credentials.
# Fixtures under any testdata/ directory are exempt - note the leading **, without
# which the negation is anchored to the repository root and silently excludes
# fixtures in nested packages.
*.jsonl
!**/testdata/**/*.jsonl
.credentials.json
.claude.json
session-sync.json
